 "drug_rule": "Finasteride is contraindicated in acute urinary retention and severe bladder outlet obstruction because it may delay resolution of obstruction and increase the risk of acute urinary retention recurrence. The drug's effect on prostate size can worsen existing obstruction, especially when the bladder is already distended and the patient is at risk of renal compromise.",
